Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:50.21,GitS 2nd Gig OP Credits,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1\fs85\c&H00FF00&}Save your tears for the day...{\i0}\N{\c&H00FFFF&}Hãy dành những giọt nước mắt cho ngày...{\i0}
